<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'>This
apps main task is to allow you to visualise temperature and humidity data t=
hat
has been recorded into a comma separated value (csv) file. </p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'><span
lang=3DEN-US style=3D'mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<h2 style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;page-break-aft=
er:
avoid'><b><span lang=3DEN-US style=3D'font-size:14.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN=
-US'>How
it works.<o:p></o:p></span></b></h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'><span
lang=3DEN-US style=3D'mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>=A0</span></span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'>Open
the app and you will have the following GUI.</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal align=3Dcenter style=3D'text-align:center'><span
style=3D'mso-no-proof:yes'><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shape id=3D"_x0000_i1041" =
type=3D"#_x0000_t75"
 style=3D'width:266.5pt;height:132.5pt;visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:sq=
uare'>
 <v:imagedata src=3D"Help_files/image003.png" o:title=3D""/>
</v:shape><![endif]--><![if !vml]><img width=3D355 height=3D177
src=3D"Help_files/image004.jpg" v:shapes=3D"_x0000_i1041"><![endif]></span>=
</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal align=3Dcenter style=3D'text-align:center'><o:p>&nbsp;=
</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'>Buttons
and other UI Controls will appear or disappear depending on the choices you=
 make
as you work with the app.</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'><u>CSV
Data<o:p></o:p></u></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'>The
folder structure where the data is stored and how it is named is important.=
 The
app starts to look under the folder Data into subfolders for the year, then
under the year into subfolders for the months (Sentence case for months). U=
nder
the months are the csv files for that month. This is illustrated below:</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'><span
style=3D'mso-no-proof:yes'><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shape id=3D"_x0000_i1040" =
type=3D"#_x0000_t75"
 style=3D'width:127.5pt;height:159.5pt;visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:sq=
uare'>
 <v:imagedata src=3D"Help_files/image005.png" o:title=3D""/>
</v:shape><![endif]--><![if !vml]><img width=3D170 height=3D213
src=3D"Help_files/image006.jpg" v:shapes=3D"_x0000_i1040"><![endif]></span>=
</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'>The
layout of the csv file is shown below:</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'><span
style=3D'mso-no-proof:yes'><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shape id=3D"_x0000_i1039" =
type=3D"#_x0000_t75"
 style=3D'width:187.5pt;height:173pt;visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:squa=
re'>
 <v:imagedata src=3D"Help_files/image007.png" o:title=3D""/>
</v:shape><![endif]--><![if !vml]><img width=3D250 height=3D231
src=3D"Help_files/image008.png" v:shapes=3D"_x0000_i1039"><![endif]></span>=
</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><u>Open Data Location<o:p></o:p></u></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>Click on the =93Open Data Location=94 button and choos=
e the
folder where all your data is stored. The app will now search that folder a=
nd list
with checkboxes all the year folders <span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>=A0</=
span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal align=3Dcenter style=3D'text-align:center'><span
style=3D'mso-no-proof:yes'><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shape id=3D"_x0000_i1038" =
type=3D"#_x0000_t75"
 style=3D'width:467.5pt;height:64pt;visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:squar=
e'>
 <v:imagedata src=3D"Help_files/image009.png" o:title=3D""/>
</v:shape><![endif]--><![if !vml]><img width=3D623 height=3D85
src=3D"Help_files/image010.png" v:shapes=3D"_x0000_i1038"><![endif]></span>=
</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>When you check the box next to the year you want the a=
pp
searches the year folder and will list the months.</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal align=3Dcenter style=3D'text-align:center'><span
style=3D'mso-no-proof:yes'><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shape id=3D"_x0000_i1037" =
type=3D"#_x0000_t75"
 style=3D'width:467.5pt;height:65pt;visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:squar=
e'>
 <v:imagedata src=3D"Help_files/image011.png" o:title=3D""/>
</v:shape><![endif]--><![if !vml]><img width=3D623 height=3D87
src=3D"Help_files/image012.png" v:shapes=3D"_x0000_i1037"><![endif]></span>=
</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>When you check the box next to the month you want the =
app
searches the month folder and will list the csv files it finds in that fold=
er.<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal align=3Dcenter style=3D'text-align:center'><span
style=3D'mso-no-proof:yes'><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shape id=3D"_x0000_i1036" =
type=3D"#_x0000_t75"
 style=3D'width:467.5pt;height:63pt;visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:squar=
e'>
 <v:imagedata src=3D"Help_files/image013.png" o:title=3D""/>
</v:shape><![endif]--><![if !vml]><img width=3D623 height=3D84
src=3D"Help_files/image014.png" v:shapes=3D"_x0000_i1036"><![endif]></span>=
</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>Now you can check the sensors that you want to graph. =
When
you have made your selection click the button called =93Load Data=94.</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal align=3Dcenter style=3D'text-align:center'><span
style=3D'mso-no-proof:yes'><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shape id=3D"_x0000_i1035" =
type=3D"#_x0000_t75"
 style=3D'width:467.5pt;height:63.5pt;visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:squ=
are'>
 <v:imagedata src=3D"Help_files/image015.png" o:title=3D""/>
</v:shape><![endif]--><![if !vml]><img width=3D623 height=3D85
src=3D"Help_files/image016.png" v:shapes=3D"_x0000_i1035"><![endif]></span>=
</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>This will now graph the Temperature and Humidity data.=
 The
graphs are in two separate tabs; click on the tab to view the data you want=
 to
view.</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

