<p class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'>The
graph will only allow 140 different sensor plots at the same time although =
with
that many plots the data will be very dense and may just look like a black
splodge.</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>=A0</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><u>A note on the Horizontal X-Axis<o:p></o:p></u></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideogra=
ph'>This
axis shows is used to plot the date and time. To allow for comparison of da=
ta
from months of different lengths or part months with data from full months =
the
date and time is converted into time from start of month. </p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

